f you are in the middle of a game, please use \u2018Stage Retry\u2019.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams and blood\u2026<br>An execution ground where sorrow never ends\u2026<br>And she was always there.<br>Wearing the joyful smile of a child at a playground\u2026<br>The people whispered behind her back, calling her<br><strong>\u201cthe Blood Princess.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is her story\u2014 <br>and the memories of the man who wished for her happiness. <br>This is the tale of the last princess of the Kingdom of Farrell.  <br>Please join her on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Game description :  <br>\u2726The game &quot;Princess And Knight&quot; is an Tactical role-playing game that follows a funny and interesting story.  <br>\u2726Play the game and you'll be welcomed by many unique characters and their stories.  <br>\u2726The game has three difficulty levels.  <br>\u2726Test your skills and luck at the difficulty level.</p>","developers":["HONG HARYONG","JUNG YOUNGJU"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142560/header.jpg?t=1768467038","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1700 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 3.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.ste